#27000
Pasiphae's Labyrinth Credits Room~
   This is a Labyrinth maze fill of minotaur mobs.  They should be about 100k
exp each.  The zone is meant to be fun and simple and meant to make people think
a bit.  The entrance room is #12.  A repeatable quest is needed to complete the
zone.  If this zone is installed without the quest #01, it becomes impossible to
complete.

Created by Enki in February of 2012.
~
